# REST API design
- Use `@RestController`, `@RequestMapping` for API controllers
- Document API endpoints with SpringDoc OpenAPI (Swagger)
- Always include descriptive Javadoc on controllers
- Validate request payloads with Bean Validation annotations (e.g., @NotNull, @Size)
- Return structured error responses with `@RestControllerAdvice`